                <pb facs="0108" n="64" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v05p1/pg64"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The information set forth above is derived from the American minutes of the
                    meeting prepared by Lucius D.
                    Battle. The Battle
                    minutes, comprising some nine wide-margined pages of manuscript, contain no
                    reference to any subject not covered in the telegraphic report printed <hi
                        rendition="#italic">infra</hi>. The original copy of the Battle minutes is included in Conference
                    files, lot 59 D 95, CF 103. Another copy of the Battle minutes is included in CFM files, lot M 88, box 161, “London–Lisbon, Misc.”</p>
            </div>
